@startuml post-logout
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/user/logout
caption CRB-10 · 보낸 refresh token 폐기

actor Client
participant "AnyStatusGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "RefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshTokenRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: POST /api/v1/user/logout\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>\n{ refresh_token }
ref over Client, Guard: authenticate() — flow/auth-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
note right of Guard: 가입 상태와 관계없이 통과 (pending · active)
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt body 검증 실패 (refresh_token 누락 · 빈 문자열)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: logout(req, user)
Controller -> Service: logout(req, userCtx)
Service -> AuthService: logout(refresh_token, userPk)
AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository: deleteByOpaqueHashAndUserPk(SHA-256(refresh_token), userPk)
RefreshTokenRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE refresh_token\nWHERE opaque_hash = ? AND user_pk = ?
note right
  다른 유저의 refresh token은 지우지 않음 (user_pk 조건).
  이미 없는 토큰이어도 성공으로 처리
end note
Service --> Controller: BaseResultDto.OK
Controller --> Client: 201 { result: "OK" }
note right of Client: access token은 서버에 저장하지 않으므로 만료까지 유효. 클라이언트에서 버림

@enduml
